,["section",{"id":"faqs"},["div",{"className":"sec-head"},["div",{"className":"eyebrow"},"FAQs"],["h2",{},["span",{},"Office Renovation "],["span",{"className":"accent"},"FAQs"]]],["div",{"className":"faqs"},["details",{"className":"faq","open":true},["summary",{},"Can you refurbish our office while staff keep working?",["span",{"className":"faq-mark","aria-hidden":"true"}]],["p",{},"Yes. We split the office into phases, move teams within the floor as each zone is finished, and schedule noisy, dusty or disruptive work after hours and at weekends, within building rules. Dust screens, clean routes and daily cleaning keep working areas usable."]],["details",{"className":"faq"},["summary",{},"How long does an office renovation take?",["span",{"className":"faq-mark","aria-hidden":"true"}]],["p",{},"A light refresh can be done in 2-4 weeks. A partial refurbishment of selected zones usually takes 4-8 weeks, and a full renovation 8-16 weeks depending on size, phasing and approvals."]],["details",{"className":"faq"},["summary",{},"Do office renovations need approvals in Dubai and Abu Dhabi?",["span",{"className":"faq-mark","aria-hidden":"true"}]],["p",{},"Most do. Painting and carpet replacement usually only need landlord permission, but changes to partitions, ceilings, lighting, AC or fire systems need landlord NOC and authority approvals such as Dubai Municipality and Civil Defence, or the municipality and Civil Defence in Abu Dhabi. We prepare and manage these for you."]],["details",{"className":"faq"},["summary",{},"How much does an office renovation cost?",["span",{"className":"faq-mark","aria-hidden":"true"}]],["p",{},"It depends on how much changes. A refresh of finishes costs far less than a full renovation with new MEP. For full renovations, our office fit out rates from AED 2,500 per sqm (Budget), AED 3,500 (Executive) and AED 6,000 (Premium) are a useful upper guide. We confirm the price after a site survey."]],["details",{"className":"faq"},["summary",{},"Should we refurbish or relocate?",["span",{"className":"faq-mark","aria-hidden":"true"}]],["p",{},"Refurbishing avoids moving costs, a new lease and a second deposit, and keeps your address. Relocating makes sense when the space no longer fits your headcount or the building limits what you can do. We can test fit your team in both scenarios so you can compare."]],["details",{"className":"faq"},["summary",{},"Can you reuse our existing furniture?",["span",{"className":"faq-mark","aria-hidden":"true"}]],["p",{},"Often, yes. We survey what you have, plan the new layout around pieces worth keeping and tell your supplier what needs replacing. We do not supply furniture ourselves."]]]]]],["section",{"className":"related","id":"all-services"},["div",{"className":"wrap"},["div",{"className":"sec-head"},["div",{"className":"eyebrow"},"Our services"],["h2",{},["span",{},"One Team for Office Interior Design "],["span",{"className":"accent"},"and Office Fit Out"]],["p",{},"Every service below is delivered by the same in-house team, so design, approvals and build stay connected from the first sketch to handover."]],["div",{"className":"rel-grid"},["a",{"className":"rel","href":"/services/interior-design"},["img",{"src":"modern-office-interior.jpg","alt":"Interior Design by Winteriors Decor"}],["div",{"className":"rel-body"},["h3",{},"Interior Design"],["p",{},"Office interior design from concept to 3D, in Dubai and Abu Dhabi."],["span",{"className":"style-link"},"Explore interior design ",["svg",{"viewBox":"0 0 16 16","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M3 8h9M8.5 4.5 12 8l-3.5 3.5","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.6"}]]]]],["a",{"className":"rel","href":"/services/turnkey-fit-outs"},["img",{"src":"glass-partition-corridor.jpg","alt":"Turnkey Fit-Outs by Winteriors Decor"}],["div",{"className":"rel-body"},["h3",{},"Turnkey Fit-Outs"],["p",{},"Design, approvals and build under one contract. Keys handed over ready to work."],["span",{"className":"style-link"},"Explo